            "review_text": "Shelley R\n9 contributions\n1\nYummy ❤️\nJan 2024 • Couples\nWe were recommended this restaurant by a friend and was definitely not disappointed. The owner was a lovely lady who took great pride in her food. We had a mixed plate of Combo Buncha +crab spring roll (to die for) +shrimp cake and tea. Excellent value and we would recommend you to come here\nWritten January 30, 2024",
