            "review_text": "Scenic36126525813\n2 contributions\n1\nBun cha with bamboo sticks is very delicious\nSep 2023 • Solo\nThis beautiful place reminds me of the old Hanoi Old Quarter. I ate grilled pork rolls on bamboo sticks, it was very delicious. Different from other restaurants I've eaten at. Today I'm not hungry enough to eat crab spring rolls. Next time I'll stop by to eat crab spring rolls and shrimp cakes.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten September 15, 2023",
